        'pilgrims.rules.title': 'Monastery Rules',
        'pilgrims.rules.short': 'To make your stay in the monastery comfortable and harmonious, please pay attention to several important points:',
        'pilgrims.rules.appearance': 'Appearance: We are grateful for choosing modest clothing. If you didn\'t have time to prepare – don\'t worry, a headscarf and a skirt can be borrowed at the entrance to the temple.',
        'pilgrims.rules.photo': 'Photo and video: We are happy when you share the beauty of Zhydychyn, so filming on the territory is allowed. However, we ask you to do it delicately, so as not to disturb the prayer of the brethren and other pilgrims.',
        'pilgrims.rules.privacy': 'Respect for private space: Remember that the monastery is primarily a home for monks. Please do not enter residential buildings or utility rooms without an invitation, respecting the owners\' right to peace.',
        'pilgrims.rules.silence': 'Silence and piety: During your stay in the temples and near the cells, please turn off the sound of phones and speak softly. This will help preserve the prayerful atmosphere for which people come to the monastery.',
        'pilgrims.rules.responsibility': 'Responsibility: General rules apply on the territory: refraining from smoking, alcohol consumption, and maintaining cleanliness. Your care is the best expression of respect for the daily work of the monastery community.',
        'pilgrims.rules.pets': 'Pets: We love animals and are happy to see you with your four-legged friends. You can walk freely with them on the territory of the monastery, but remember that entry with animals directly into the temples is prohibited. We also ask you to take care of the cleanliness and safety of other visitors.',

        'pilgrims.schedule.title': 'Service schedule',
        'pilgrims.schedule.short': 'Services in the monastery are performed daily. To plan your visit, use our interactive service schedule.',
        'pilgrims.schedule.calendar_hint': 'Choose the required date in the calendar to see current information and a detailed schedule of services for that day.',
        'pilgrims.schedule.groups_title': 'For pilgrim groups and parishes',
        'pilgrims.schedule.pastor': 'Pilgrimage with a pastor: We sincerely welcome the initiative when communities come for services together with their priest.',
        'pilgrims.schedule.program': 'Spiritual program: After the service, a cognitive excursion of the monastery will be organized for your group.',

        'pilgrims.excursions.title': 'Excursions',
        'pilgrims.excursions.short': 'The Tourist Information and Pilgrimage Center is responsible for organizing and conducting excursions in the monastery. We offer visitors professional routes through temples and dungeons that reveal the thousand-year heritage of the monastery.',
        'pilgrims.excursions.types': 'Three types of excursions: we offer routes different in duration and content.',
        'pilgrims.excursions.versatility': 'Versatility: we conduct both individual walks and group tours.',
        'pilgrims.excursions.no_borders': 'Without borders: it is possible to order an excursion in a foreign language.',
        'pilgrims.excursions.booking': 'Details and booking: A full description of all objects and routes is available on the Center\'s website zhydychyn.center',

        'pilgrims.transport.title': 'How to get there',
        'pilgrims.transport.short': 'The monastery is located in the village of Zhydychyn, just a few kilometers from Lutsk. We have made sure that your path to the monastery is as convenient as possible, regardless of the chosen method of transportation.',
        'pilgrims.transport.public': 'Public transport: Suburban buses regularly run from Lutsk to the village (in particular, routes No. 51, No. 117, No. 149, from the "RC Promin" stop). The journey takes about 15–20 minutes.',
        'pilgrims.transport.car': 'Own car: Zhydychyn has convenient connections with the international highway M19 (Kovel – Chernivtsi). A high-quality paved road leads to the monastery.',
        'pilgrims.transport.bike': 'Bicycle route: Thanks to the proximity to the city and picturesque views along the Styіr River, the road to Zhydychyn is a popular route for bicycle walks.',
        'pilgrims.transport.taxi': 'Taxi: Due to the short distance, the cost of a trip from the center of Lutsk to the monastery gates remains affordable. Estimated cost is 180-250 UAH.',
        'pilgrims.transport.bus_tip': 'Tip: If you are traveling in a large group on your own bus, a special parking lot for oversized vehicles is provided on the territory of the monastery.',

        'pilgrims.lodging.title': 'Lodging and Food',
        'pilgrims.lodging.short': 'Currently, the monastery does not have its own refectory or hotel, but we are actively working on creating comfortable conditions for our guests.',
        'pilgrims.lodging.food': 'Food: We recommend the nearby Restaurant and Hotel complex "Ostriv".',
        'pilgrims.lodging.sleep': 'Lodging: Hotels and hostels within a radius of 5–10 km (Lutsk) are available for pilgrims. We are also forming a database of private green tourism estates directly in Zhydychyn.',
        'pilgrims.lodging.future': 'Perspectives and cooperation: Our goal is to create a gastronomic and residential space that will reveal the heritage of Ancient Zhydychyn. We are open to cooperation with specialists and investors.',

        'pilgrims.help.title': 'Help',
        'pilgrims.help.short': 'We are sincerely grateful for every open heart. You can join the life of the monastery in various ways, choosing what is closer to you:',
        'pilgrims.help.prayer': 'Prayer help: The most valuable support is your sincere prayer for the brethren and the development of our holy place.',
        'pilgrims.help.volunteer': 'Volunteer work: We invite you to labor for the glory of God. You can help in the care of the monastery garden, apiary, in the kitchen, or during preparation for large holidays.',
        'pilgrims.help.finance': 'Financial support: Your donations are directed to the restoration of temples, construction of new objects, and maintenance of the monastery.',
        'pilgrims.help.social': 'Social projects: We are open to help in the implementation of our charitable and cultural initiatives, the main of which are presented at the link.',
        'pilgrims.help.footer': 'Any action of yours – be it physical labor or financial support – is a significant contribution to the preservation of the Zhydychyn Monastery.',

